                      <strong>Access Constraints:</strong>
                      <div class="small">
                        
  <p>None.</p>

                      </div>
                    
                    
                      <strong>Use Constraints:</strong>
                      <div class="small">
                        
  <p>NOT FOR LEGAL USE. These limits and boundaries were created for internal purposes only to update the charted maritime limits and maritime boundaries on NOAA charts. These limits and boundaries do not represent the official depiction. For official depiction, please see NOAA&#39;s Electronic Navigational Charts (ENCs).</p>

                      </div>
                    
                  </div>
                </div>
              

