  <p>Single dataset in WGS84 of digital state/regional maritime limits, created by merging published ESRI Shapefiles from NOAA&#39;s Office of Coast Survey website.  Dataset was merged with the US/Canada international boundary to create the approved US maritime limits and boundaries dataset. | Source Geospatial Form: geodatabase feature class | Type of Source Media: online</p>

